{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34419","headline":"奉和袭美吴中言怀寄南海二同年 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美吴中言怀寄南海二同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾见凌风上赤霄，尽将华藻赴嘉招。\n城连虎踞山图丽，路入龙编海舶遥。\n江客渔歌冲白荇，野禽人语映红蕉。\n庭中必有君迁树，莫向空台望汉朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}